I had the same problem, dgamelaunch closed and my console didn't take 
any command from me anymore. I think, I solved that with copying all the 
files manually to the correct folders AND creating an inprogress folder 
manually. The script created a folder 'inprogress' , but it is not used 
by any default setting! I suggest you to give it one more try and create 
in  ../dgamelaunch/dgldir/ the folder inprogross-nethack/ and edit your 
config file like this:

# the second game
game_num = 1
game_path = "/bin/nethack"
game_name = "NetHack 3.4.3"
short_name = "NH343"
game_args = "/bin/nethack"
game_args = "-u"
game_args = "%n"
spooldir = "/var/mail/"
rc_template = "/dgl-default-rcfile"
rc_fmt = "%rrcfiles/%n.nethackrc"
savefilefmt = "/var/games/nethack/save/%u%n.gz"
inprogressdir = "inprogress-nethack/"

After this it should work

